{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:38:56+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T07:38:56+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"LEM Holding SA","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"Switzerland","city":"Meyrin","website":"https://www.lem.com","employees":1730,"summary":"LEM Holding SA, together with its subsidiaries, provides measuring electrical parameters solutions in China, Japan, South Korea, India, Southeast Asia, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, NAFTA, and Latin America. The company offers current, voltage, integrated current, and Rogowski coil sensors, as well as energy meters; and provides after-sales and return merchandise authorization services. Its products are used in automotive battery management and motor control, electric vehicle chargers, smart grid, welding, automation, drives, high-precision, power supplies, renewable energies, trackside, and traction applications. The company was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Meyrin, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"LEM Holding SA, avec ses filiales, fournit des solutions de mesure de paramètres électriques en Chine, au Japon, en Corée du Sud, en Inde, en Asie du Sud-Est, en Europe, au Moyen-Orient, en Afrique, en ALENA et en Amérique latine. La société offre des capteurs de courant, de tension, de courant intégré et de bobine de Rogowski, ainsi que des compteurs d'énergie; et fournit des services d'autorisation après-vente et de retour de marchandises. Ses produits sont utilisés dans la gestion des batteries automobiles et le contrôle des moteurs, les chargeurs de véhicules électriques, les réseaux intelligents, le soudage, l'automatisation, les entraînements, la haute précision, les alimentations électriques, les énergies renouvelables, les applications sur piste et de traction."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":70588